&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N7sHd2bSQoDHOqx5oHtuXzGWsZb&quot;&gt;Working closely with Licensing, Legal, Product and the regional business teams, you will ensure every licensed entity launches with the appropriate operational controls and continues to meet its ongoing regulatory obligations.&lt;/div&gt;
