&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;98405043-e11f-4830-a861-7b126729a55e-7-2-0&quot;&gt;System optimization: solid knowledge of Linux OS; understanding of middleware internals and engineering practices (e.g., etcd, Nacos, Kafka)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
