&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lg7yd3bPsodLHmxk1iTui74zskf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;A genuine interest in the cryptocurrency industry and belief in its long-term potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
